Press Ctrl+C once to stop the foreground job_board_app.py, then re-run the full stack. Both Python services that import auth.py load the signing_key from Vault only at process start, so export Vault variables again and restart all three services:
------------------------

export VAULT_ADDR='https://vault-fmx9i8k5.lab.practical-devsecops.training'
export VAULT_TOKEN=$(cat ~/.vault-token)
export AUTH_SERVER_URL='https://devsecops-box-gpu-fmx9i8k5-8000.lab.practical-devsecops.training'
pkill -f auth_server.py
pkill -f mcp_server.py
python3 auth_server.py &
python3 mcp_server.py &
python3 job_board_app.py


